{"title":"Hanekotchi","ru":"Ханэкотчи","kind":"character","url":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/Hanekotchi","blocks":[{"tag":"p","text":"Hanekotchi (はねこっち) — девочка Tamagotchi, которая появляется исключительно в Ura Jinsei Enjoy Tamagotchi Plus. Ее коллега-мужчина — Haneotchi."},{"tag":"h2","text":"О персонаже"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Стадия роста"},{"tag":"p","text":"Ребёнок"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Родной город"},{"tag":"p","text":"Город Уратама"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Семья"},{"tag":"p","text":"Ура Мем Группа"},{"tag":"h4","text":"Электронные питомцы"},{"tag":"p","text":"Женщина:"},{"tag":"li","text":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus"},{"tag":"li","text":"Tamagotchi School"},{"tag":"h2","text":"Происхождение имени"},{"tag":"h2","text":"Внешность"},{"tag":"p","text":"Hanekotchi имеет круглый розовый корпус. У нее светло-розовые щеки и блестящие глаза, похожие на глаза Memetchi. У нее два крыла; левый темно-розовый, а правый желтый."},{"tag":"h2","text":"Характер"},{"tag":"p","text":"Hanekotchi любит коллекционировать блестящие вещи. Когда она находит что-то редкое и блестящее, ее глаза ярко блестят."},{"tag":"row","text":"Официальные описания"},{"tag":"h2","text":"О виртуальных питомцах"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus"},{"tag":"p","text":"Hanekotchi — девочка в семье Ура Меме. Она эволюционирует из Ura Memeputchi. Она эволюционирует в Ura Young Memetchi при хорошем уходе и в Ura Young Violetchi при плохом уходе."},{"tag":"h2","text":"Галерея"},{"tag":"h3","text":"Современное Искусство"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Happy"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Грустно"},{"tag":"caption","text":"Tamagotchi Баннер к 30-летию"}],"imageSource":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchi30thAnniversary_ArtBanner.png","gallery":[{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hanekotchi_happy.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e4/Hanekotchi_happy.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20150929034542","caption":"Радуется","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e4/Hanekotchi_happy.png/revision/latest?cb=20150929034542"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hanekotchi_sad.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/e/e1/Hanekotchi_sad.png/revision/latest?cb=20150929034554","caption":"Грустит"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/b8/b85c8322e3b6b4bb79cf.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tamagotchi30thAnniversary_ArtBanner.png","caption":"Баннер к 30-летию Tamagotchi"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hanekotchi_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/0/07/Hanekotchi_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20141221142807","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Ханэкотчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Hanekotchi.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/98/Hanekotchi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20211013043410","caption":"Портрет · Ханэкотчи","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/98/Hanekotchi.png/revision/latest?cb=20211013043410"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-school-toy-f0c8d5","title":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","ru":"Tamagotchi School (toy)","kind":"device","note":""},{"id":"ura-jinsei-enjoi-tamagotchi-plus-68a64c","title":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","ru":"Ura Jinsei Enjoi Tamagotchi Plus","kind":"device","note":""}]}